DESCRIPTION:HAHA BONBON PRESENTS LITTLE HAHAs and BABY OTTERJETS \nA collection of small works\, little chunks\, and compact art – made by friends!! \nShow runs July 1 – July 30 with Opening reception July 17 from 6-9pm (Durham’s Third Friday). \nFeaturing works by Familiar Dolls\, Rose Field\, Michelle Lyon\, Paige Boy Studio and Tim Thayer. \nCompletely inappropriate for the whole family. Come on out and see art – it’s free!
