SUMMARY:WUNC Spotlight: Drawing your Community-Storytelling & Zine Making with Eli Chen
DESCRIPTION:What do illustrated journalism\, community stories\, and a good craft night have in common?\nJoin WUNC News for our upcoming spotlight Drawing your Community with Eli Chen\, a creative night of storytelling\, conversation\, and hands-on crafting. Part journalist talk\, part community hangout and part zine-making workshop\, this WUNC Spotlight invites you to explore how stories can take shape far beyond the page.\nWUNC News digital storyteller and illustrator Eli Chen will share some of their favorite projects\, from illustrated reporting and social media storytelling to community-centered zines. Participants will take a behind the scenes look at how journalism and art come together to tell stories in new ways.\nThen it’s your turn! Using simple folding techniques and a single sheet of paper\, you’ll create your own mini zine inspired by your experiences. Don’t worry\, we’ll have prompts! Along the way\, you’ll have the chance to ask questions\, share ideas\, and connect with fellow makers in a relaxed\, craft-night atmosphere.\nWhether you’re an artist\, a journalist\, a longtime zine enthusiast or someone who just likes making cool things with your community\, this evening is for you. No artistic experience is required and all materials will be provided.\nCome hang out\, get inspired\, and leave with a tiny publication…and maybe a few new connections.\nThis event is part of WUNC’s 50th anniversary celebration\, featuring 50 events across North Carolina that bring people together through community\, conversation\, and storytelling.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/wunc-spotlight-drawing-your-community-storytelling-zine-making-with-eli-chen/
LOCATION:WUNC Public Radio Suite 600\, 324 Blackwell st. Suite 600\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Art,Classes & Workshops,Community Engagement,Craft,Free
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Postcard-Front.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="WUNC Public Radio":MAILTO:events@wunc.org
GEO:35.993377;-78.9051601
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=WUNC Public Radio Suite 600 324 Blackwell st. Suite 600 Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=324 Blackwell st. Suite 600:geo:-78.9051601,35.993377
END:VEVENT
