SUMMARY:Cake Art Night
DESCRIPTION:An evening where cake meets canvas. Grab a palette\, pick your colors\, and paint directly onto a large cake in a free-form\, collaborative art experience. No piping skills required—just show up\, get creative\, and leave your mark (then maybe eat it\, too). $12 includes all materials & a drink to sip on while you work.
