SUMMARY:Blackberry Smoke
DESCRIPTION:Throughout their career\, Blackberry Smoke have embodied Georgia’s rich musical legacy\, honoring the people\, places and sounds of their home state. Their latest album\, Be Right Here draws inspiration from Southern rock\, blues-leaning classic rock and rootsy vintage country and is full of vivid and relatable characters that ensure the songs often resemble rich short stories. \nOver the past two decades\, Blackberry Smoke has amassed the following of a loyal fanbase\, leading their last six full-length albums to achieve great chart success\, including 2021’s You Hear Georgia\, which reached #1 on Billboard’s Americana/Folk Albums chart and 2024’s Be Right Here\, which reached the top 5 on the Top Current Album Sales chart. \nTouring relentlessly\, the band know a little something about hitting the road in order to find a place to belong\, and supported by the strong fanbase of Brothers and Sisters\, legions of whom travel across the globe to support the band\, they in turn give fans a palace to belong. \nOver the years the band has appeared across the globe on stages such as Austin City Limits\, Bonnaroo\, Summerfest\, Glastonbury\, Download UK\, to name a few\, and has no plans to stop anytime soon. \nFor Blackberry Smoke\, embracing the light and finding the silver lining are once again at the heart of what they do best. \nLearn more about Blackberry Smoke at BlackberrySmoke.com
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/blackberry-smoke-2/
LOCATION:DPAC Presented by First Horizon\, 123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Concert,Live Performance,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BlueberrySmoke1080x1080.jpg
GEO:35.9939816;-78.9026312
