UID:10233160-1783717200-1783721700@downtowndurham.com
SUMMARY:Single Woman: Work In Progress
DESCRIPTION:Single Woman: Work In Progress is an original solo comedy show about a very unoriginal topic: Dating. In the absence of a romantic relationship\, the next best thing is the attention of a rapt audience. For as long as Tess has been single (forever)\, the best part of dates has been telling stories about them after. Now she’s ready to share them with everyone else [with names redacted]. \nOver this 75-minute show\, Tess weaves personal storytelling and audience participation about what it means to be 35\, ready to mingle\, and obsessed with finding meaning in everything. Part comedy show\, part catharsis\, and part singles event (for Tess). For anyone 18+ who has wondered why dating is so weird. Bring your single straight male friends. Seriously. By the way\, it’s not a work in progress. The single woman IS the work in progress\, y’know?
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/single-woman-work-in-progress/
LOCATION:Mettlesome\, 800 Taylor St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Singles & Dating,Storytelling
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Durham-Mettlesome-poster.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Mettlesome":MAILTO:noreply@facebookmail.com
GEO:35.99116;-78.889691
